flowchart TD
    alert[Alert fires] --> ack{Acknowledged<br>within 5 min?}
    ack -->|no| escalate[Page secondary]
    escalate --> ack
    ack -->|yes| triage[Triage]
    triage --> sev{Severity}
    sev -->|SEV1| war[Open war room]
    sev -->|SEV2| fix[Fix in business hours]
    sev -->|SEV3| ticket[File a ticket]
    war --> mitigate[Mitigate] --> resolve[Resolve]
    fix --> resolve
    resolve --> pm[Write postmortem]
